# Data 360 dual-report & chat starters

## When the user starts a chat or asks what to run

Offer **suggestion prompts** from [prompts/chat-starters.md](../../prompts/chat-starters.md)
(and the copy-paste block in [prompts/example-prompts.md](../../prompts/example-prompts.md)).
Prefer prompts that already name **dataspace + populated DMO(s)** so you do not re-ask
routing questions.

Recommended first offers (one HCP Stage + one DTC):

1. STG-US HQ email opens 90d on `stg_Headquarter_Email_Engagement__dlm`
2. DTC Premarin brand + opt-in on `DTC_BrandProfile__dlm` + `DTC_ContactPointConsent__dlm`

## Every count answer (HCP and DTC)

1. Dual-report **table**: Data 360 row + Snowflake source row + Delta.
2. If Snowflake cannot be tallied, keep Count **PENDING**, show validation SQL + query output.
3. Always include this note when Snowflake is PENDING (or when teaching dual-report):

> **Note:** Authenticate the Snowflake MCP once so the agent can fill the Snowflake count instead of PENDING.

4. Do not invent empty-path demos (Stage profiles/consent; Dev geo/consent; DTC email engagement audiences).
